t":28},{"id":29,"type":30,"tags":31,"lang":15,"slug":32,"first_publication_date":33,"last_publication_date":34,"link_type":18,"key":35,"isBroken":20},"ZjosahIAACMA1DDS","form-v2",[],"from-4.09","2024-05-07T13:41:33+0000","2024-08-02T07:54:55+0000","8d8c1527-3aef-49ee-85d4-36974a4a615c",{"heading":37,"includeInternational":38,"desktopBackground":39,"tabletBackground":40,"mobileBackground":41},"Arrange a courier collection",true,{},{},{},"hero_banner$ae38ae93-0ad7-4492-bf00-af829d958d40","hero_banner",null,{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":47,"primary":49,"id":77,"slice_type":78,"slice_label":44},"default-slice",[48],{},{"CardImage":50,"CardAvatar":62,"CardTitle":63,"CardText":64,"ButtonText":44,"ButtonUrl":75,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":51,"alt":54,"copyright":44,"url":55,"id":56,"edit":57},{"width":52,"height":53},1000,665,"An Evri Courier smiling towards a customer after having completed a doorstep collection. The courier is holding multiple parcels, whilst the customer is holding a blue slip containing the details of the delivery.","courier-service.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDoZbqstJ9-cff_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4287.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6pDoZbqstJ9-cff",{"x":58,"y":59,"zoom":60,"background":61},0,8,1,"transparent","none","Quick parcel collection from home",[65,69,72],{"type":66,"text":67,"spans":68},"paragraph","Working with more than 18,000 local Couriers across the UK, it’s never been easier to arrange an Evri parcel collection straight from your door for a swift and safe delivery service.",[],{"type":66,"text":70,"spans":71},"Simple to book and affordably priced, our local Couriers can pick up your parcel from almost any UK address, including workplaces, businesses, and more – all arranged on a day of your choosing to match your schedule.",[],{"type":66,"text":73,"spans":74},"Best of all, our Courier collection team will even alert you with a 1-hour estimated time of arrival on your chosen pick-up day, meaning you can be in to greet them.",[],{"link_type":76},"Any","card$147978e4-52fe-4d0f-a803-a8378bfd18a7","card",{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":80,"primary":102,"id":109,"slice_type":110,"slice_label":44},[81,84,87,90,93,96,99],{"column_1_cell":82,"column_2_cell":83,"column_3_cell":44,"column_4_cell":44},"0-1kg Small","£4.04",{"column_1_cell":85,"column_2_cell":86,"column_3_cell":44,"column_4_cell":44},"0-1kg Standard","£4.30",{"column_1_cell":88,"column_2_cell":89,"column_3_cell":44,"column_4_cell":44},"1-2kg Small","£4.52",{"column_1_cell":91,"column_2_cell":92,"column_3_cell":44,"column_4_cell":44},"1-2kg Standard","£5.78",{"column_1_cell":94,"column_2_cell":95,"column_3_cell":44,"column_4_cell":44},"2-5kg","£7.58",{"column_1_cell":97,"column_2_cell":98,"column_3_cell":44,"column_4_cell":44},"5-10kg","£7.68",{"column_1_cell":100,"column_2_cell":101,"column_3_cell":44,"column_4_cell":44},"10-15kg","£11.29",{"SectionTitle":103,"SectionSubtitle":104,"TableFooter":105,"InformationTableButtonUrl":106,"InformationTableButtonText":44,"table_header_row_blue":20,"table_rightmost_column_blue":20,"column_name_1":107,"column_name_2":108,"column_name_3":44,"column_name_4":44},"How much does it cost for a courier collection?","Want to book a courier collection? All our collection prices are dependent on weight, so it’s easy to work out how much it will cost to have your parcel collected and sent. See our pricing for courier collection using our Standard delivery service:","Our small parcel prices are for parcels measuring up to 45cm x 35cm x 16cm and measuring up to 2kg. Our small parcel product is part of our summer sale, which ends on 31\u002F08\u002F2026. Our standard parcel prices are for parcels weighing up to 15kg, no longer than 120cm, and with an overall maximum circumference and length of up to 245cm. All our prices are quoted for standard delivery, with delivery within 2-4 working days from collection.",{"link_type":76},"Weight","Collection price","information_table_v2$edf74239-3456-4255-ab6f-736b23b40062","information_table_v2",{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":112,"primary":155,"id":159,"slice_type":160,"slice_label":44},[113,120,127,134,141,148],{"title":44,"content":114,"isNumbered":38,"icon":118,"image":119},[115],{"type":66,"text":116,"spans":117},"Enter your parcel’s collection and delivery postcodes",[],{},{},{"title":44,"content":121,"isNumbered":38,"icon":125,"image":126},[122],{"type":66,"text":123,"spans":124},"Tell us your parcel’s weight",[],{},{},{"title":44,"content":128,"isNumbered":38,"icon":132,"image":133},[129],{"type":66,"text":130,"spans":131},"Choose standard delivery",[],{},{},{"title":44,"content":135,"isNumbered":38,"icon":139,"image":140},[136],{"type":66,"text":137,"spans":138},"Select Courier collection",[],{},{},{"title":44,"content":142,"isNumbered":38,"icon":146,"image":147},[143],{"type":66,"text":144,"spans":145},"Enter in any requested parcel details",[],{},{},{"title":44,"content":149,"isNumbered":38,"icon":153,"image":154},[150],{"type":66,"text":151,"spans":152},"Click continue to finalise the booking process",[],{},{},{"theme":156,"title":157,"description":158,"showPaddingTop":20},"standard","How to book a local Courier collection","At Evri, we’ve made our parcel booking process as simple as possible. All you need to do is fill in a quick form, including your parcel’s weight and dimensions, so we can give you an accurate price. You can then book parcel collection and delivery up to 7 days in advance or as early as tomorrow – whatever’s best for you.\n\nJust follow the steps below to book your local Courier collection today:","list_block$33806805-b54e-485a-a8cb-7914651dfe35","list_block",{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":162,"primary":164,"id":188,"slice_type":189,"slice_label":44},[163],{},{"Image":165},{"dimensions":166,"alt":169,"copyright":44,"url":170,"id":171,"edit":172,"mobile":174,"tablet":181},{"width":167,"height":168},1200,280,"An Evri Courier is walk